Package: duop
Version: 2.11.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kostiantyn Nedbailo <ChessPlayerSedoy@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/BlackKostia/duop
Description: Ultra-fast zero-libc dual-pane TUI file manager
 Duop is a dual-pane terminal file manager shipped as a single static
 ~250 KB ELF with no libc and no third-party libraries (freestanding C23
 over an assembly platform layer). TrueColor UI, background copy/move with
 conflict resolution, io_uring batch stat, fuzzy finder, command palette,
 archive VFS (browse, unpack, pack), git status, syntax highlighting, image preview (Kitty/Sixel),
 hex editor, ELF inspector and an embedded PTY terminal.
